smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ304000/RJ303199_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ304000/RJ303199_img_smp3.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ304000/RJ303199_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ304000/RJ303199_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ304000/RJ303199_img_smp3_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "Pachi Pachi On A Roll - Unleashed [Dolores Entertainment]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "パチンコとピンボールをミックスした楽しい作品です。", "body": [{"intro": "『Pachi Pachi on a Roll – Unleashed』は、パチンコとピンボールをミックスした楽しい作品です。32以上のの異なったミッションを攻略し4つのワールドをクリアしよう! <br />\n<br />\n電車を奪ったり、UFOやドラゴンを負かしたりしながら衛星を起動させ、ボールの数字を見逃さずに高得点を達成させてベストランキングを目指そう!シーンに合わせてドレスアップも可能!<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nAbout Pachi Pachi On A Roll Unleashed Pachi Pachi on a Roll - Unleashed is a fun mix of pachinko and pinball, where you have to complete more than 32 different missions to clear the 4 worlds. <br />\n<br />\nRobbing a train, defeating UFOs, activating satellites without losing sight of the number of balls you have left to obtain the highest possible score, and be the best in the ranking. <br />\n<br />\nDress up for the occasion, complete all missions, fight giant UFOs, defeat dragons, and rob a train, to get the highest score possible in this fun mix of pachinko and pinball."}]}], "description": "パチンコとピンボールをミックスした楽しい作品です。", "short_introduction": "パチンコとピンボールをミックスした楽しい作品です。", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ303199.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794961030}